Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:17.03,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Fairy tales are such bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:23.84,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,It's always some girl getting a spell cast\Non her that turns her into a princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.96,Italics,ninny,0,0,0,,getting to wear a pretty dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.15,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,pretending to choose some hot guy\Nand being chosen herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.13,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Not to mention, the spell randomly \Nbreaks in the middle of it all. Lame, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.01,Top,Paparazzi A,0,0,0,,Here she comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:32.13,Top,Papapazzi,0,0,0,,It's Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.42,Top,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:36.39,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Yet, for some reason, \Nevery girl wants to be a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:36.39,Top,Paparazzi A,0,0,0,,Nice hoodie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:38.47,Top,Paparazzi A,0,0,0,,Is it true you broke up with TJ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:40.64,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Like, are you serious?\NThe spell just breaks randomly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.47,0:00:40.22,Top,Paparazzi B,0,0,0,,We haven't seen you together for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.03,Top,Paparazzi C,0,0,0,,Did you find someone new?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:43.56,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,It was inevitable because\Nyou broke your promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:44.89,Top,Paparazzi D,0,0,0,,Just give us a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.57,0:00:46.06,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Or time ran out, so what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.15,Top,Paparazzi D,0,0,0,,I heard someone left the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:47.90,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,But you {\i0}can{\i1} do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:50.75,Top,Paparazzi C,0,0,0,,What do you think about losing a member?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:51.46,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,You're all fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.82,Top,Paparazzi E,0,0,0,,You didn't get along with Macy, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:55.32,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,None of you know the real \Nreason the spell breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:53.99,Top,Paparazzi E,0,0,0,,Was it always like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:55.86,Top,Paparazzi B,0,0,0,,Is that the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:58.16,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,So irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:00:59.32,Default,Paparazzi A,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:05.89,Default,Paparazzi A,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:08.13,Default,Paparazzi B,0,0,0,,What the hell was that insane flash?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:22.74,Default,Paparazzi,0,0,0,,She went in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.11,0:01:25.92,Default,Paparazzi A,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:29.08,Default,Paparazzi B,0,0,0,,She disappeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:32.61,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,If magic only works on fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:37.59,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,I'd rather be the one casting the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.71,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,The tip of my finger, the edge of my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.40,0:01:49.33,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Revenger Joe's Iron Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:52.09,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Five locks, three chains, silence-sheathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:54.21,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,A blast from the pipe to blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.97,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Please don't use magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:07.22,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Your magic will make your antlers... bloom...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:13.07,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Blue Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:25.79,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Magic Number 44: Flash Bumper!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:32.24,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:33.77,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,That's a bud buck, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:37.11,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,That's an A-rank harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:40.43,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,What were you gonna do\Nif I didn't make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:45.68,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from someone \Nwho shows up so appallingly late,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:46.94,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Ninny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:52.19,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,I told you to stop calling me by my\Nfirst name! I have seniority here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:49.10,Default,Caption,0,0,0,,{\fsp5\an7\blur1\bord0\b1\shad2\fs36\c&H9F05F8&\4c&HFFFFFF&\frz11.5\pos(6,39.333)\clip(m 40 23 l 40 230 3 230 3 23)}Ninny\NSpangcole
