Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:03.49,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Where do you get off casually making \Ndemands of your seniors like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:08.57,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,Dragons: mythical creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:13.50,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,But in truth, they are neither\Nmythical nor creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:20.16,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,Since time immemorial,\N72% of all deaths in London
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:24.01,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,have been caused by grotesque\Nbeings known as dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:30.25,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,That is why they are so prominently\Ndisplayed on London's coat of arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:34.37,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,Rampaging dragons cause\Ngreat harm to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:40.06,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,In order to prevent that,\Nthe dragons must be monitored.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:45.26,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,The citizens of Front London\Ncannot see the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:49.83,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,But there's also a Reverse London.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:56.04,Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,Only those who live on the reverse\Nside of London can see the dragons.
