Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:04:04.85,Top Italics,Nar,0,0,0,,It inevitably fell to the people of Reverse\NLondon to take care of and manage the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:07.18,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5\3a&H80&\4a&H80&\b0\shad1.5\fs24\fnTimes New Roman\an8\blur1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(316,282.667)}Wing Bind Headquarters Building
